# FairPulse

Project Scope

FairPulse combines lightweight smart milestone logging with automated invoice tracking. Every milestone, deliverable submission, and invoice timestamp is cryptographically verified to prevent retrospective client disputes and guarantee milestone payouts.

Project Vision & Scope

To build and deploy a dynamic, compliant, and user-centric platform that seamlessly connects Gig Workers with Clients, while ensuring continuous adherence to local and international Regulators.


In-Scope:
Gig Worker Onboarding, Skill Verification and Automated Payouts.
Client Portal for task posting, real-time tracking and rating.
Automated Regulatory Compliance & Tax Reporting Layer.
Real-time matching algorithm and messaging system.

Out-of-Scope:

Full-time employee payroll management.
On-premise hardware installations.


